<section class="page-hero">
  {% include "partials/breadcrumbs.njk" %}
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">What we do</p>
    <h1>Commercial and industrial painting services</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Nine service lines, one crew, one point of contact. We work days, nights,
      weekends and shutdown periods across Victoria, and every job comes with a
      written scope, a site-specific SWMS and a five-year warranty.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="visually-hidden">All services</h2>
    <ul class="card-grid">
      {%- for s in services.services -%}
      <li>
        <a class="service-card" href="/services/{{ s.slug }}/">
          <span class="service-card__icon">{{ icon(s.icon) }}</span>
          <h3 class="service-card__title">{{ s.title }}</h3>
          <p class="service-card__body">{{ s.short }}</p>
          <span class="service-card__more">See how we do it</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section section--pale">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Not sure which one you need?</p>
      <h2>Describe it, we'll tell you</h2>
      <p class="lede">
        Most enquiries are not a clean fit for a single service line. "The floor
        looks tired and the line marking has gone" is really a floor coating plus
        line marking plus a shutdown conversation.
      </p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn btn--green" href="/contact/">Send us a description</a>
        <a class="btn btn--outline" href="tel:{{ site.phone | tel }}">Call {{ site.phoneDisplay }}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <h3>Things people commonly ask us for together</h3>
      <ul class="checks">
        <li><strong>Warehouse refresh:</strong> epoxy floor + line marking + wall and column repaint, done over a shutdown.</li>
        <li><strong>Factory exterior:</strong> tilt-up panel and structural steel coating, scaffold or rope access, with a colour you can live with for fifteen years.</li>
        <li><strong>Office fit-off:</strong> pre-construction interior coating, two-pack finishes and joinery, sequenced around other trades.</li>
        <li><strong>Water ingress first:</strong> we find and fix the leak or the failed membrane, then paint it. Painting over a leak just buys you a second leak.</li>
        <li><strong>Multi-site roll-out:</strong> the same repaint programme across several buildings, staggered so the organisation is never fully disrupted.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section section--green">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Sectors</p>
      <h2>We paint these, and only these</h2>
      <p>
        We are a commercial and industrial contractor. That is not a limitation —
        it means the crew has seen your type of building before and knows what
        the access, the hazards and the hold-ups look like.
      </p>
    </div>
    <ul class="chips">
      {%- for i in services.industries -%}
      <li>{{ i }}</li>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

